              <img class="ccdisplay" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0062/5793/4454/files/cc-mastercard-2x.png">
              <img class="ccdisplay" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0062/5793/4454/files/paypal.png">
			</p>
